WEBVTT

01:40.000 --> 01:41.640
When I was a kid,

01:41.720 --> 01:45.080
my family lived in a lively rural house.

01:45.160 --> 01:46.760
Back then, in my hometown,

01:46.840 --> 01:48.480
there was fresh air,

01:48.560 --> 01:51.560
boundless fields,
and plenty of smoke from chimneys.

01:51.640 --> 01:53.760
Even the sunset

01:53.840 --> 01:56.440
seemed to smell like orange.

01:57.480 --> 01:59.040
In the courtyard,

01:59.120 --> 02:00.840
we planted two grape vines,

02:00.920 --> 02:02.560
and my dad set up a trellis.

02:02.640 --> 02:04.000
When summer came,

02:04.080 --> 02:06.800
the grape vines
would grow all over the trellis.

02:06.880 --> 02:09.520
After dinner, my family would

02:09.600 --> 02:12.640
sit under the shade,

02:12.720 --> 02:16.840
and the entire courtyard
was filled with the fragrance of grapes.

02:18.240 --> 02:20.400
Okay. Thank you, Granny.

02:23.080 --> 02:24.120
Let's call it a day.

02:24.200 --> 02:25.120
Okay.

02:39.480 --> 02:40.320
Cheng!

02:40.400 --> 02:42.160
- Cheng! Cheng!
- What's wrong?

02:42.720 --> 02:44.760
- Got a cramp!
- Where?

02:45.560 --> 02:46.800
My arm, my arm!

02:46.880 --> 02:47.840
Here?

02:48.520 --> 02:50.160
Yes, right there.

02:50.240 --> 02:52.240
- How is it?
- Better.

02:52.320 --> 02:54.560
It's not serious.

02:54.640 --> 02:56.440
Apply some herb oil to it later.

03:04.160 --> 03:06.360
Mr. Tang. Get off me.

03:11.840 --> 03:12.880
Mr. Tang!

03:13.400 --> 03:14.880
Get off me!

03:16.000 --> 03:17.160
Get off me!

03:18.360 --> 03:20.920
Mr. Tang, please talk nicely.

03:21.000 --> 03:23.280
If I made a mistake, I'll correct it.

03:27.400 --> 03:28.560
That guy.

03:30.000 --> 03:31.080
He…

03:31.160 --> 03:32.040
likes you?

03:35.360 --> 03:36.960
Su Wenxin?

03:37.040 --> 03:38.320
Of course, he likes me.

03:39.720 --> 03:40.680
What about you?

03:42.080 --> 03:43.200
Do you like him?

03:44.400 --> 03:45.960
Of course.

03:51.920 --> 03:53.960
I'm his sister.

03:54.040 --> 03:55.440
Of course, I like him.

03:57.000 --> 03:58.040
Sister?

04:00.920 --> 04:01.960
Su…

04:05.200 --> 04:06.160
His surname is also Su.

04:06.240 --> 04:09.520
Yes, Su Wenxin is my cousin.

04:12.400 --> 04:14.400
A real cousin,
not someone created by the filter.

04:24.360 --> 04:26.040
"Don't worry about getting old.

04:30.440 --> 04:31.720
You'll look cute when you're old."

04:36.320 --> 04:37.320
I'm flattered.

04:38.080 --> 04:40.360
Zhu Shenghao said this to Song Qingru.

04:41.480 --> 04:42.440
It suits today's theme.

04:50.120 --> 04:51.400
This morning,

04:52.200 --> 04:54.600
I saw you and your cousin
buy cakes in the shop.

04:56.560 --> 04:57.400
I got upset.

04:58.560 --> 04:59.760
I thought

05:01.440 --> 05:04.040
you were slacking off during work time.

05:06.440 --> 05:07.760
It turns out it was because I…

05:41.520 --> 05:44.000
A bird's nest just fell down.

06:03.560 --> 06:04.600
Mr. Tang.

06:08.000 --> 06:08.880
Mr. Tang?

06:11.120 --> 06:12.120
Su Chengcheng.

06:14.680 --> 06:15.800
Did you hear it?

06:20.080 --> 06:22.400
Hear what?

06:24.960 --> 06:26.400
My heart is racing because of you.

07:22.040 --> 07:22.960
Tang Qi.

07:23.480 --> 07:25.280
I already apologized to you.

07:25.360 --> 07:27.120
Even if you don't want to forgive me,

07:27.200 --> 07:28.880
you can fire me or…

07:28.960 --> 07:29.840
beat me.

07:29.920 --> 07:32.000
You can punish me as you want,
and I won't fight back.

07:32.080 --> 07:34.200
But how could you fool me like this?

07:34.280 --> 07:35.840
I'm not fooling you.

07:36.680 --> 07:38.080
I really like you.

07:39.160 --> 07:40.520
You like me?

07:41.160 --> 07:43.240
You like Su Miao's pretty face

07:43.320 --> 07:45.520
and Fang Jin's personality.

07:46.800 --> 07:48.200
I have nothing.

07:48.280 --> 07:49.600
Why do you like me?

07:51.840 --> 07:54.120
You're both Su Miao and Fang Jin.

07:55.640 --> 07:57.040
I've realized that

07:57.840 --> 07:59.520
no matter who you become,

08:00.560 --> 08:01.600
I'll always

08:02.360 --> 08:03.600
like you.

08:09.920 --> 08:11.520
I won't use the filter again.

08:12.040 --> 08:13.120
Stop dreaming.

08:15.160 --> 08:16.080
Su Cheng…

08:17.480 --> 08:19.280
Su… Su Chengcheng!

08:24.400 --> 08:25.400
Su…

08:31.680 --> 08:32.559
Cheng.

08:33.080 --> 08:33.960
Cheng.

08:34.480 --> 08:35.880
Sister.

08:36.640 --> 08:38.520
Mr. Tang and you were

08:38.600 --> 08:39.799
hugging each other.

08:41.159 --> 08:42.559
You're so impressive.

08:42.640 --> 08:44.760
I saw you drag him into your arms.

08:45.320 --> 08:46.960
It was an accident.

08:47.760 --> 08:50.760
Sister, it's okay for a woman
to pursue a man.

08:50.840 --> 08:52.520
But you can't throw him down

08:52.600 --> 08:53.840
just because he rejected you.

08:53.920 --> 08:55.280
If Aunt finds out, she'll ask Uncle

08:55.360 --> 08:56.600
to teach you a lesson.

08:57.680 --> 08:59.480
I was rejected?

08:59.560 --> 09:01.880
After all, he's a successful man.

09:01.960 --> 09:03.800
You have quite the eye.

09:04.320 --> 09:06.320
However, you can't force someone

09:06.400 --> 09:07.520
to like you.

09:09.200 --> 09:10.840
Do you think I don't deserve him?

09:11.680 --> 09:12.520
Sister.

09:12.600 --> 09:14.240
Sister, that's not what I meant.

09:14.320 --> 09:16.480
Well, Mr. Tang is so weak.

09:16.560 --> 09:18.720
He can't handle your moves.
He doesn't deserve you.

09:18.800 --> 09:20.760
I'll introduce my friend
from our sports school to you.

09:20.840 --> 09:21.960
You can beat him as you want.

09:22.040 --> 09:24.000
Why don't you find me a sandbag?

09:24.080 --> 09:25.200
It's the toughest thing.

09:26.280 --> 09:28.360
That's not what I meant.

09:28.440 --> 09:29.680
I mean a man like Mr. Tang

09:29.760 --> 09:33.000
must like someone pretty, gentle, and…

09:33.600 --> 09:36.000
Enough. You're making it worse.

09:40.840 --> 09:42.280
Don't be upset.

09:42.360 --> 09:44.560
Mr. Tang has bad taste.
You're really good.

09:45.440 --> 09:47.120
I'm not upset at all.

09:47.200 --> 09:48.480
Get back to work.

09:50.560 --> 09:51.480
Thanks.

09:53.280 --> 09:54.320
I'm leaving.

10:00.800 --> 10:02.000
I'm so inarticulate.

10:06.800 --> 10:10.200
DIDI RIDE-HAILING

10:32.640 --> 10:33.720
Su Chengcheng.

10:34.880 --> 10:36.000
Did you hear it?

10:38.360 --> 10:41.200
Hear what?

10:43.560 --> 10:44.840
My heart is racing because of you.

10:49.960 --> 10:51.800
Why are you filming this?

10:53.680 --> 10:54.880
So ugly.

11:18.920 --> 11:20.000
Tang Qi.

11:20.080 --> 11:22.800
You like Su Miao's pretty face

11:22.880 --> 11:24.600
and Fang Jin's personality.

11:24.680 --> 11:25.880
I have nothing.

11:25.960 --> 11:27.320
Why do you like me?

12:17.840 --> 12:20.760
SOUL DETECTIVE

12:42.920 --> 12:43.840
Hello.

12:45.760 --> 12:48.080
Do you have Su Chengcheng's photos?

12:48.720 --> 12:51.040
Only a few group photos. No single ones.

12:51.920 --> 12:54.840
From now on,
except for my girlfriend's photos,

12:54.920 --> 12:56.080
I only have

12:56.160 --> 12:57.840
my mom and my grandma's photos.

12:59.800 --> 13:01.000
Congrats. For you and Lin Yuan.

13:02.400 --> 13:03.320
Thanks.

13:04.520 --> 13:06.520
It seems you've figured it out.

13:11.320 --> 13:14.200
I finally realized why I could only see
the color of Su Chengcheng.

13:38.600 --> 13:39.880
My heart saw through

13:41.320 --> 13:43.560
everything before my eyes did.

13:57.000 --> 13:59.240
It's not too late to realize it.

14:00.640 --> 14:02.480
If she doesn't want
to come into your world,

14:03.600 --> 14:05.120
you'll go to her world.

16:07.120 --> 16:09.520
Sorry about what happened yesterday.

16:10.040 --> 16:10.880
It was too impulsive.

16:14.480 --> 16:16.400
I shouldn't have thrown you down.

16:16.920 --> 16:17.760
We're even.

16:20.320 --> 16:21.480
Let me give you a ride.

16:21.560 --> 16:22.400
Thanks, Mr. Tang,

16:22.480 --> 16:23.880
but I prefer to take the subway.

16:24.880 --> 16:26.280
I'll also take the subway.

16:29.640 --> 16:32.280
Tang Qi, what do you want?

16:37.920 --> 16:39.240
Perhaps there are

16:40.680 --> 16:41.680
some misunderstandings.

16:43.600 --> 16:44.800
I didn't

16:45.840 --> 16:47.920
confess my feelings for you
for revenge or fun.

16:51.600 --> 16:52.800
I really like you.

17:02.520 --> 17:04.560
If I reject you,

17:04.640 --> 17:06.200
will you fire me?

17:07.359 --> 17:08.200
No.

17:09.880 --> 17:12.040
Mr. Tang, I don't like you.

17:12.119 --> 17:13.319
Please don't follow me

17:13.400 --> 17:15.960
or send me wrong signals.

17:17.040 --> 17:18.280
I don't want

17:18.359 --> 17:20.440
to spend time with you except for work.

17:41.640 --> 17:43.360
On the day I took my wedding photos,

17:44.720 --> 17:48.040
the entire photo studio was filled

17:48.560 --> 17:50.320
with the fragrance of Jasmine.

17:51.320 --> 17:52.640
Today,

17:52.720 --> 17:54.960
it feels like I'm back to that day.

17:56.560 --> 17:57.520
Back then,

17:58.040 --> 18:00.880
he said he couldn't afford wedding rings,

18:01.640 --> 18:03.960
so he made a bouquet for me.

18:10.040 --> 18:11.440
A fragrance

18:11.520 --> 18:13.880
is not just about the present
but about the past.

18:13.960 --> 18:15.440
The beautiful things in life

18:15.520 --> 18:17.080
shouldn't wither as time goes by

18:17.160 --> 18:19.640
but become more precious.

18:20.160 --> 18:23.080
I suggest we use not only young people

18:23.160 --> 18:24.720
but old people to present

18:24.800 --> 18:25.680
White Pony Perfume.

18:28.320 --> 18:30.320
- She has a point.
- That's right.

18:32.440 --> 18:33.840
Old brand ambassador.

18:33.920 --> 18:35.480
That's too bold.

18:36.080 --> 18:37.840
There are precedents abroad,

18:37.920 --> 18:38.880
but…

18:39.400 --> 18:40.280
it's too risky.

18:41.880 --> 18:42.880
Well,

18:42.960 --> 18:45.040
how old should the brand ambassador be?

18:45.120 --> 18:46.400
Sixty to 70 years old.

18:46.480 --> 18:47.560
No plastic surgery,

18:47.640 --> 18:48.840
but with the traces of time.

18:50.280 --> 18:51.600
It's a bold proposal.

18:51.680 --> 18:52.760
But…

18:52.840 --> 18:54.440
if we use an old person,

18:54.520 --> 18:56.200
will young people think

18:56.280 --> 18:57.880
our perfume is not fashionable?

18:58.600 --> 19:00.120
In your proposal, you suggest

19:00.200 --> 19:02.760
we use people in their twenties,
forties, and sixties,

19:02.840 --> 19:03.680
three generations.

19:04.400 --> 19:06.640
Will this lead
to a vague theme of the perfume

19:06.720 --> 19:08.080
and make it hard to promote?

19:08.680 --> 19:11.800
I think only three generations of people

19:11.880 --> 19:15.240
can truly present the connotation
of this perfume.

19:15.320 --> 19:17.440
Time flies by, but the fragrance remains.

19:22.680 --> 19:24.320
You have a point,

19:24.400 --> 19:25.840
but…

19:26.360 --> 19:27.680
I support Su Chengcheng.

19:34.760 --> 19:36.320
In recent years,

19:36.400 --> 19:38.880
fashion and beauty products have become

19:38.960 --> 19:41.800
popular among old people.

19:41.880 --> 19:43.360
It has high demand.

19:43.440 --> 19:45.520
In April 2020,

19:46.040 --> 19:47.160
the sales revenue of cosmetics

19:47.240 --> 19:50.680
for old people on Taobao
reached 15.23 million yuan,

19:50.760 --> 19:54.080
many times that of ten months ago.

19:54.600 --> 19:57.160
According
to the consumer trend report of JD.com,

19:57.240 --> 19:59.200
in the first eight months of 2022,

19:59.800 --> 20:01.720
the transaction volume
of grey-haired people

20:01.800 --> 20:03.400
is three times that of 2018.

20:04.160 --> 20:05.960
Just like fashion, perfume

20:06.760 --> 20:08.560
shouldn't be limited by age.

20:08.640 --> 20:10.640
The fashion industry
can present the clothes

20:10.720 --> 20:11.880
of old ladies to the world.

20:11.960 --> 20:14.800
Why can't we share the fragrance of memory

20:14.880 --> 20:16.520
with more people?

20:22.360 --> 20:23.920
I also support Su Chengcheng.

20:24.800 --> 20:26.120
Do we have a candidate

20:26.200 --> 20:27.280
in her sixties?

20:28.000 --> 20:28.880
Yes.

20:31.240 --> 20:32.080
Bai Mingzhu.

20:32.160 --> 20:35.440
Everyone knew her back in the 1980s

20:35.520 --> 20:36.520
and 1990s.

20:36.600 --> 20:37.440
JINMEI & FENGHUA AWARD, BEST ACTRESS

20:37.520 --> 20:39.000
With excellent acting,

20:39.080 --> 20:41.000
she won both domestic
and international awards.

20:41.640 --> 20:43.800
Last year, she showed up

20:43.880 --> 20:46.440
in Milan Fashion Week as a model

20:46.520 --> 20:47.880
and impressed everyone.

20:47.960 --> 20:50.480
She's been low-key and hard-working.

20:50.560 --> 20:51.800
Her works are famous,

20:51.880 --> 20:53.480
but her personal life is a secret.

20:53.560 --> 20:55.320
She's a mysterious beauty.

20:55.400 --> 20:56.360
I think

20:56.440 --> 20:58.640
she can perfectly present our perfume.

21:02.200 --> 21:04.280
It's hard to hire her.

21:04.360 --> 21:05.520
Is there a backup plan?

21:06.560 --> 21:08.080
There's no second-best choice.

21:27.080 --> 21:29.400
Su Chengcheng will be in charge
of the promotion plan

21:31.160 --> 21:32.720
of White Pony Perfume.

21:35.840 --> 21:36.800
Thanks.

21:36.880 --> 21:38.000
Don't get carried away.

21:38.080 --> 21:41.080
If you can't get in touch
with Ms. Bai in three days,

21:41.160 --> 21:43.600
we'll give up on the idea
of an old brand ambassador.

21:46.880 --> 21:48.320
Okay, I got it.

21:51.280 --> 21:52.120
FISHERMAN'S GARDEN RESTAURANT

21:56.280 --> 21:57.840
"WHITE PONY" PERFUME PROPOSAL

22:14.840 --> 22:16.200
We can't get in touch with Bai Mingzhu.

22:16.280 --> 22:18.120
She won't participate
in any business activities.

22:18.200 --> 22:20.320
I contacted the managers
of the platforms Mr. Gu told me,

22:20.400 --> 22:22.600
but they didn't know Ms. Bai's schedules.

22:26.040 --> 22:28.440
Chengcheng, have you got any information
from the fan groups?

22:28.520 --> 22:30.920
Ms. Bai has retired

22:31.000 --> 22:32.440
and lives an old-fashioned life.

22:32.520 --> 22:34.440
Her itinerary is a secret. No clues.

22:34.520 --> 22:36.920
Mr. Zhou only gave us three days.

22:37.000 --> 22:38.200
If we fail,

22:39.120 --> 22:40.200
we'll have to change the plan.

22:42.120 --> 22:45.840
WHOLE MILK

22:52.640 --> 22:53.600
THOUSAND BIRDS COLLECTION

23:15.720 --> 23:16.800
You're so thoughtful.

23:16.880 --> 23:18.760
Tell me what you want from me.

23:18.840 --> 23:21.400
Here are Ms. Bai's interviews
of all these years.

23:31.120 --> 23:31.960
It's very detailed.

23:33.440 --> 23:34.400
Thanks.

23:35.880 --> 23:38.320
Why do you care
about our department so much?

23:41.760 --> 23:43.920
We're all working for the same company.

23:49.240 --> 23:52.120
I've provided my resources to them.

23:52.200 --> 23:54.280
However, Ms. Bai is special.

23:54.360 --> 23:55.920
She's almost retired.

23:56.000 --> 23:58.480
She doesn't participate
in business activities.

23:59.120 --> 24:00.880
When I was collecting the information,

24:01.400 --> 24:03.640
I couldn't find anything about her
before the age of 22.

24:03.720 --> 24:06.160
I only know she wasn't properly trained,

24:06.240 --> 24:08.400
and she had a husband
before becoming an actress,

24:08.480 --> 24:10.640
but there are no reports
about her ex-husband.

24:11.440 --> 24:13.000
You reminded me.

24:13.080 --> 24:15.520
She became famous early
and also divorced early.

24:15.600 --> 24:18.240
Perhaps someone can help us.

24:25.120 --> 24:27.240
Mr. Tang, I'm busy.

24:27.320 --> 24:30.080
Except for work,
we have nothing to talk about.

24:35.800 --> 24:37.080
I want to talk about work.

24:39.000 --> 24:40.920
I'll meet with Bai Mingzhu's
granddaughter later.

24:41.000 --> 24:42.600
Does she have children?

24:44.840 --> 24:46.360
She divorced before her debut.

24:46.440 --> 24:48.040
Few people know she has a son.

25:01.520 --> 25:02.360
Let's go.

25:36.200 --> 25:38.200
She's Ms. Bai's granddaughter.

25:39.360 --> 25:40.800
Yes, Jiang Xizhen.

25:41.680 --> 25:43.920
Ms. Bai's son grew up with his father.

25:44.000 --> 25:46.000
With Ms. Bai's protection,

25:46.080 --> 25:47.120
people have never found out

25:47.200 --> 25:49.160
that she not only
has a son and a granddaughter

25:49.240 --> 25:51.480
but loves them very much.

25:55.560 --> 25:56.680
Ms. Jiang.

26:03.560 --> 26:07.120
She's beautiful and fit.

26:07.640 --> 26:10.360
She's the combination
of Su Miao and Quan Shengtang.

26:12.680 --> 26:14.120
Hello, Ms. Jiang.

26:14.200 --> 26:16.480
This is Su Chengcheng
from our Marketing Department.

26:16.560 --> 26:19.160
Hello, Su Chengcheng. I'm Jiang Xizhen.

26:20.880 --> 26:21.920
Hello.

26:38.760 --> 26:40.440
Sorry for that.

26:43.080 --> 26:46.200
Sympathetic nerves that control heartbeat
can be adjusted by breathing.

26:46.280 --> 26:47.120
Blowing air on the thumb

26:47.200 --> 26:49.440
can slow your heartbeat
and help you relax.

26:51.200 --> 26:53.520
Ms. Jiang has a PhD in neurobiology.

26:53.600 --> 26:55.280
Su Miao's face,

26:55.360 --> 26:57.680
Quan Shengtang's fitness,

26:57.760 --> 27:00.000
and Fang Jin's brain.

27:01.120 --> 27:03.960
I've never seen such a perfect woman.

27:04.040 --> 27:04.880
I'm a little nervous.

27:05.560 --> 27:07.440
Never seen?

27:07.520 --> 27:09.360
Su Chengcheng, don't you remember me?

27:09.440 --> 27:10.800
We were in the same high school.

27:12.600 --> 27:14.520
- Sorry.
- It's okay.

27:14.600 --> 27:16.440
I transferred to another school
after a semester.

27:16.520 --> 27:17.400
I understand why you forgot me.

27:18.200 --> 27:19.520
In Grade 10,

27:19.600 --> 27:21.880
I secretly kept a photo of Senior Tang,

27:21.960 --> 27:23.360
but you took it away.

27:23.440 --> 27:25.600
You told me to focus on my studies.

27:25.680 --> 27:27.800
You said Peking University
was better than him.

27:29.520 --> 27:31.800
You're hopeless.

27:31.880 --> 27:33.600
We're in Grade 10.

27:33.680 --> 27:35.160
Why can't you

27:35.240 --> 27:38.160
focus on your studies?

27:38.240 --> 27:39.720
Isn't Peking University better than him?

27:41.640 --> 27:43.160
I really said that?

27:43.240 --> 27:44.200
I don't remember.

27:45.320 --> 27:46.600
I thought…

27:47.400 --> 27:48.720
you were bullying her.

27:49.320 --> 27:50.760
Do I look like a bully?

27:51.600 --> 27:53.600
Chengcheng never bullied anyone.

27:53.680 --> 27:56.520
This is ridiculous.

27:59.480 --> 28:01.680
Sorry for that.

28:08.800 --> 28:09.640
Senior Tang,

28:09.720 --> 28:13.120
do you know you were so popular back then?

28:13.200 --> 28:14.080
Ms. Jiang.

28:14.600 --> 28:16.480
Let's get to the point.

28:18.000 --> 28:18.920
Sorry.

28:19.000 --> 28:20.120
I have a competition later.

28:20.200 --> 28:21.600
- Let's talk right here.
- Okay.

28:22.240 --> 28:24.240
We're grateful
that you're willing to meet us.

28:24.920 --> 28:28.120
Su Chengcheng,
I've always wanted to see you.

28:28.200 --> 28:29.960
I've been thinking about you a lot.

28:31.320 --> 28:33.840
I'm so glad to see you today.

28:35.480 --> 28:36.320
Come on.

28:47.760 --> 28:48.600
Ms. Jiang.

28:49.280 --> 28:50.440
Check this out.

28:50.960 --> 28:52.800
This is our proposal.

28:54.320 --> 28:55.480
Su Chengcheng.

28:56.120 --> 28:57.160
You've changed.

29:00.840 --> 29:03.040
Time can change everything.

29:03.120 --> 29:04.720
Can't we go back?

29:07.520 --> 29:09.400
Jiang Xizhen, read the proposal.

29:32.200 --> 29:35.560
I like this proposal.

29:36.080 --> 29:36.920
However,

29:37.640 --> 29:40.840
it's not easy to get
my grandma's approval.

29:40.920 --> 29:42.280
If this is all you've got,

29:42.360 --> 29:44.440
I'm afraid I can't help you.

29:49.080 --> 29:51.200
What does Ms. Bai really want?

29:51.880 --> 29:55.560
She has awards, fame, and money.

29:55.640 --> 29:58.240
She often says that at her age,

29:58.320 --> 29:59.680
time is precious.

29:59.760 --> 30:02.280
She only wants to spend time
with her loved ones

30:02.360 --> 30:03.600
and do what she likes.

30:06.640 --> 30:09.320
Time flies by, but the fragrance remains.

30:09.400 --> 30:11.200
That's what we want to express.

30:11.720 --> 30:13.800
Does Ms. Bai have some precious memories?

30:14.640 --> 30:16.040
Precious memories?

30:23.360 --> 30:25.760
This photo is very important to her,

30:25.840 --> 30:28.040
but I broke it by accident.

30:28.120 --> 30:29.800
She didn't say anything,

30:29.880 --> 30:31.720
but I knew she was upset,

30:31.800 --> 30:33.560
so I scanned this photo

30:33.640 --> 30:34.760
and made a digital version.

30:34.840 --> 30:37.280
I hired many people,
but they couldn't repair it.

30:38.960 --> 30:39.800
This is my grandma.

30:41.760 --> 30:44.440
This school badge looks familiar.

30:44.520 --> 30:46.080
It looks like a tree.

30:53.320 --> 30:54.320
This is an ivy.

30:54.400 --> 30:55.840
Our middle school used to be

30:55.920 --> 30:57.560
Fancheng United University Middle School,

30:57.640 --> 30:58.760
and this was the school badge.

31:00.160 --> 31:02.960
They're holding
the same poetry collection.

31:03.040 --> 31:05.920
I think this photo was taken
after a school activity ended.

31:06.600 --> 31:07.560
Maybe

31:07.640 --> 31:09.720
we can find the information
and the photo in school.

31:09.800 --> 31:12.000
If you can find it,

31:12.080 --> 31:13.320
my grandma will be so moved.

31:13.400 --> 31:14.880
We'll look for it now.

31:14.960 --> 31:16.760
If we find it, I'll tell you immediately.

31:17.840 --> 31:19.000
That's great.

31:19.080 --> 31:20.360
If it weren't for the competition,

31:20.440 --> 31:21.800
I'd definitely join you.

31:21.880 --> 31:23.680
Please send the photo to me.

31:23.760 --> 31:25.960
Whether we find it or not,
I'll let you know.

31:32.000 --> 31:33.040
Senior Tang.

31:34.400 --> 31:35.320
Do you have a girlfriend?

31:41.800 --> 31:42.640
No.

31:46.240 --> 31:48.800
This is the love letter
taken by Su Chengcheng.

31:48.880 --> 31:50.080
Today,

31:50.680 --> 31:51.560
I want to give it to you.

31:53.800 --> 31:55.040
I'll leave you alone.

32:02.280 --> 32:03.480
I don't have a girlfriend.

32:04.640 --> 32:06.160
But I have someone I like.

32:13.400 --> 32:15.320
Senior Tang, good luck.

32:25.920 --> 32:28.440
FANCHENG EXPERIMENTAL MIDDLE SCHOOL

32:28.520 --> 32:30.360
Goodbye.

32:31.440 --> 32:33.880
- Bye.
- Slow down. Be safe.

32:39.160 --> 32:41.360
We're here for real business.

32:41.440 --> 32:43.600
We can ask
the school leaders to let us in.

32:45.720 --> 32:47.720
Mr. Zhou only gave you three days.

32:47.800 --> 32:50.200
More precisely, only two days left.

32:50.280 --> 32:52.640
Do you have enough time to get

32:52.720 --> 32:53.760
the approval of the school leaders?

33:03.720 --> 33:06.480
Be careful when playing basketball.
There are many cars.

33:06.560 --> 33:08.280
- Goodbye.
- Goodbye, sir.

33:08.360 --> 33:09.280
Goodbye.

33:09.920 --> 33:12.080
- Goodbye, sir.
- Goodbye.

33:13.440 --> 33:15.240
- Goodbye, sir.
- Goodbye.

33:16.680 --> 33:19.640
- Why do they look a bit old?
- Goodbye, sir.

33:41.880 --> 33:43.520
So many books.

33:43.600 --> 33:45.120
How can we find it
without a search engine?

33:48.560 --> 33:49.440
Over there.

34:17.920 --> 34:20.120
FANCHENG EXPERIMENTAL
MIDDLE SCHOOL LIBRARY

34:20.760 --> 34:22.880
According to the information on the photo,

34:23.480 --> 34:26.120
I think Ms. Bai went to a reading club.

34:28.560 --> 34:30.679
Considering her age…

34:30.760 --> 34:32.560
SCHOOL HISTORY

34:32.639 --> 34:33.800
…the reading club…

34:33.880 --> 34:35.679
SCHOOL ART FESTIVAL

34:37.560 --> 34:38.600
…should be in these years.

34:40.560 --> 34:42.960
ENTERING YEAR, FROM 1970 TO 1980

35:16.720 --> 35:17.960
I brought this.

35:18.040 --> 35:20.200
It can help you clear your head.

35:45.520 --> 35:46.560
Back then…

35:48.040 --> 35:50.160
Did you crush the walnut because…

35:52.600 --> 35:54.080
you wanted to share it with me?

36:19.720 --> 36:20.800
Don't overthink it.

36:21.400 --> 36:22.880
I like sharing things.

36:22.960 --> 36:25.360
No matter who it was,
I would share it with them.

36:31.560 --> 36:32.760
Back then,

36:34.120 --> 36:35.960
you crushed the walnut in front of me.

36:38.280 --> 36:39.520
I thought you were threatening me.

36:41.600 --> 36:42.440
I thought

36:43.680 --> 36:45.000
you didn't want me to sit there.

36:47.240 --> 36:50.160
Didn't you escape
because you thought I was ugly?

36:53.280 --> 36:54.160
You thought…

36:54.680 --> 36:56.040
I wanted to kick you out?

36:57.680 --> 36:58.600
Sorry.

37:00.800 --> 37:02.080
I got you wrong.

37:09.320 --> 37:10.720
Do you dare to eat my stuff?

37:19.640 --> 37:20.920
I even dare to like you.

37:21.760 --> 37:23.160
Why should I be afraid of this?

37:25.600 --> 37:27.400
We don't have time. Stop talking nonsense.

37:27.480 --> 37:28.480
Hurry up and work.

40:02.520 --> 40:04.360
FANCHENG UNITED UNIVERSITY
MIDDLE SCHOOL READING CLUB

40:09.240 --> 40:10.120
Found it.

40:13.400 --> 40:15.720
1997 FANCHENG EXPERIMENTAL MIDDLE SCHOOL
READING CLUB REPRESENTATIVE

40:19.440 --> 40:20.440
BAI MINGZHU

40:20.520 --> 40:21.680
Bai Mingzhu.
